{"title":"Career Roadmap · Wind Site Assessor","role":"Wind Site Assessor","summary":"A Wind Site Assessor evaluates locations for wind-energy projects by analyzing wind resources, terrain, climate, environmental conditions, accessibility, grid connectivity, land constraints, and long-term energy potential. The role supports wind-farm developers, renewable-energy companies, engineering consultants, and project-development teams.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc. (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Renewable Energy Science"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Typical route:"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Sc. Renewable Energy Science → Wind/Energy Internship → Junior Wind Resource Analyst / Site Assessment Executive → Wind Site Assessor → Senior Wind Resource Analyst → Wind Resource/Project Development Manager"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons: 2026–2046","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2028"},{"text":"Student / Renewable Energy Intern"},{"text":"Wind science + meteorology"}],[{"text":"2028–2030"},{"text":"Junior Wind Analyst / Site Assessment Executive"},{"text":"Wind data + GIS"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Wind Site Assessor / Wind Resource Analyst"},{"text":"Resource assessment + modelling"}],[{"text":"2033–2037"},{"text":"Senior Wind Resource Analyst"},{"text":"Site optimization + uncertainty"}],[{"text":"2037–2042"},{"text":"Wind Resource / Site Assessment Lead"},{"text":"Project-level technical decisions"}],[{"text":"2042–2046"},{"text":"Wind Development / Resource Manager"},{"text":"Portfolio + strategic development"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Key Skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Energy + physics foundation"},{"text":"Physics, mathematics, energy systems"},{"text":"Renewable-energy project"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Wind science"},{"text":"Meteorology, wind characteristics, measurement"},{"text":"Wind-data analysis"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Site assessment"},{"text":"GIS, remote sensing, statistics, wind modelling"},{"text":"Site-assessment project"}],[{"text":"Year 4 (if applicable)"},{"text":"Industry readiness"},{"text":"Resource assessment, uncertainty, energy yield"},{"text":"Wind internship + final project"}],[{"text":"Post-graduation"},{"text":"Specialization"},{"text":"Wind resource assessment + project development"},{"text":"Professional experience"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Build the Scientific Foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Physics"},{"type":"p","text":"Strengthen:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mechanics"},{"text":"Fluid mechanics fundamentals"},{"text":"Thermodynamics"},{"text":"Energy conversion"},{"text":"Electricity"},{"text":"Measurement systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mathematics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Calculus"},{"text":"Trigonometry"},{"text":"Differential equations"},{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Numerical methods"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Renewable energy"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Solar"},{"text":"Wind"},{"text":"Hydropower"},{"text":"Biomass"},{"text":"Geothermal"},{"text":"Energy storage"},{"text":"Electricity grids"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["For a wind career, physics","statistics","meteorology become especially important."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Learn Wind Science"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how atmospheric conditions determine wind-energy potential."},{"type":"h","text":"Wind fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wind speed"},{"text":"Wind direction"},{"text":"Wind shear"},{"text":"Turbulence"},{"text":"Air density"},{"text":"Wind profiles"},{"text":"Wind rose"},{"text":"Weibull distribution"},{"text":"Wind-power density"}]},