"},{"type":"p","text":"Produce:"},{"type":"flow","items":["GIS layers","suitability model","candidate zones","wind-resource analysis","technical report"]},{"type":"p","text":"Clearly label it as an academic screening study, not a bankable wind-resource assessment."}]},{"heading":"Certifications and Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Prioritize practical skills in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Wind"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wind-resource assessment"},{"text":"Wind measurement"},{"text":"Energy-yield assessment"},{"text":"Wind-farm layout"}]},{"type":"h","text":"GIS"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"QGIS"},{"text":"ArcGIS"},{"text":"Remote sensing"},{"text":"Spatial analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"SciPy"},{"text":"matplotlib"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Meteorology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Atmospheric science"},{"text":"Weather data"},{"text":"Numerical weather concepts"}]}]},{"heading":"Software to Become Familiar With","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Depending on employer requirements, learn the concepts and workflows associated with tools such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"WindPRO"},{"text":"OpenWind"},{"text":"WAsP"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"QGIS"},{"text":"ArcGIS"},{"text":"MATLAB"},{"text":"Excel"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Commercial software access may be expensive, so students can initially demonstrate the underlying methodology using Python, QGIS, spreadsheets, and open datasets."}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential entry-level roles include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Wind"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wind Site Assessment Executive"},{"text":"Junior Wind Resource Analyst"},{"text":"Wind Resource Analyst"},{"text":"Wind Data Analyst"},{"text":"Wind Measurement Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Renewable energy"},{"type":"